      "$description": "UI short-name slot aliases — the W2-era token API still consumed by packages/ui component CSS and microsite-next's @theme bridge (census 2026-08-18: --copper ×5, --text-muted ×15, --accent-prime ×9, … referenced bare with no definition since the tiered rename). Each alias resolves to its tiered canon token so Storybook/ui/next rendering becomes honest (ADR-0003: S5 depends on S2 for exactly this). Purely additive for microsite-astro: none of these names are referenced there. UNRESOLVABLE names are deliberately ABSENT — --chrome-text(-hover/-active), --chrome-background, --chrome-border, --chrome-indicator, --surface-page, --surface-inset, --rail-edge, --grid-line have no defined value anywhere in repo or archive history (forward-declared only); filed as an S5 gap rather than invented here."
